{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-e19f9b65082755b840faf5ea02e59ad5802f81ab51460fd1","family_id":"KR:010860","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 36520, July 21, 2026>","title_original":"환경교육의 활성화 및 지원에 관한 법률 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288151","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288151","source_sha256":"636fb103b4547621ebf925e6eb1c318e6cdce495a979d9734669b1ec0cbfeac2","body_sha256":"6b77c14b2fcd94cfdbe9d97be87219aa9f63307a1fc68d43c735badddf67148b","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 36520, July 21, 2026>\n\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date) This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2027; provided, the amended provisions of Article 2 and only those amended provisions of Article 3 concerning Integrated Special Metropolitan Cities and Integrated Special Metropolitan City Mayors shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation, and the amended provisions of Article 3 (excluding provisions concerning Integrated Special Metropolitan Cities and Integrated Special Metropolitan City Mayors) shall enter into force on September 26, 2026.\n\nArticle 2 (Special provisions concerning the qualifications of environmental educators) A person who has been granted a qualification specified in the left-hand column of the following table under the previous Appendix 1 as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed granted the qualification specified in the right-hand column of that table under the amended provisions of Appendix 1.\n\n<table dir=\"ltr\"><tbody>\n<tr><td dir=\"auto\">Environmental educator, Grade 2</td><td dir=\"auto\">Environmental educator, Grade 1</td></tr>\n<tr><td dir=\"auto\">Environmental educator, Grade 3</td><td dir=\"auto\">Environmental educator, Grade 2</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n","metadata":{"author_audit_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.10